# Slumbering Keepguard: "Whenever an enchantment you control enters, scry 1." and "{2}{W}: This creature gets +1/+1 until
# end of turn for each enchantment you control." Turn 1: Keepguard, then Flood (scry 1: the Mox Ruby on top goes to the
# bottom) and Holy Strength on the Keepguard (scry 1: the Island on top stays), so Bot1 draws that Island on turn 3. Turn 2:
# Bot2's own Flood enters: no scry for Bot1 (`! Bot1.Arrange`). Turn 3: {2}{W} with two enchantments of Bot1's and one of
# Bot2's on the battlefield: +2/+2 only, so the Keepguard (1/1, +1/+2 from Holy Strength) is 4/5 until end of turn and a
# 2/3 again on turn 5.

